  "raw": {
    "https://www.chowan.edu/about/offices/business-affairs/make-a-payment/": {
      "title": "Make a Payment",
      "description": "Make a Payment | Chowan University Skip to content Apply Visiting Chowan Request Info Tuition Deposit Menu open extended navigation Make a Payment Home About Offices Business Affairs Make a Payment Prospective Students Application Fee – Students applying for admission into Chowan University must pay the non-refundable $20 application fee by clicking here . New Student Advanced Tuition Deposit Advanced Tuition Deposit – Students wishing to enroll at Chowan University are required to submit the $100 advanced tuition deposit by clicking here. When coupled with the completed Housing Preference Form, the deposit secures your spot in student housing and qualifies you to attend Student Orientation Advising and Registration (SOAR). Graduate Student Tuition Deposit – Students wishing to enroll in a graduate program at Chowan University are required to submit a $150 advanced tuition deposit. To make your deposit, click here . For more information regarding the graduate school enrollment process, please contact us at 252-398-1236. Graduate Student Tuition Deposit Deposits are refundable if requested in writing prior to May 1st for students enrolling in the Fall and December 1st for students enrolling in the Spring. If you would like to pay your Application Fee or Advanced Tuition Deposit by mail, please indicate the student’s full name, make your check payable to Chowan University, and mail to: Attn: Admissions Chowan University One University Place Murfreesboro, NC 27855 If you would like to make a payment in person, please stop by the Office of Admissions located at 100 High Street, Murfreesboro, NC 27855. If you need assistance making your online payment, please contact Admissions at (252) 398-1236. Enrolled Students Make Payments Online All tuition payments, payment plans, and account management are now available through Chowan University’s secure online payment portal. Visit: chowan.edu/pay From the payment portal you can: Make a one-time tuition payment Enroll in a monthly payment plan View your student account balance Access your account as a student or invited payer Pay using bank account, credit card, Apple Pay, Google Pay, and other available payment methods If you would like to make a payment in person, please stop by the Business Office located on the ground floor of McDowell Columns Hall. If you need assistance making your online payment, please call the Business Office at (252)-398-6318 Payment plan options, fees, and disclosures will be presented during enrollment. Availability may vary. Payment plans are powered by Illumia. All credit card payments must be completed through the online payment system. Credit card payments for tuition are no longer accepted by phone or in person. The Business Office still accepts cash and check payments in person. Alumni, Supporters, and Former Students Charitable Gifts – Benefactors looking to invest in the life and longevity of Chowan University may give a charitable donation by clicking here . Purchases – If you would like to make a purchase through the Office of Advancement please click here . You will be prompted to describe the item you would like to purchase. Tuition Payments – Former students wanting to make an online tuition payment may remit a payment by clicking here . Ways to Give Secure Online Giving 252-398-1233 Chowan University Development Office One University Place Murfreesboro, NC 27855 Payments by Mail Please make checks payable to: Chowan University Mail Payments to: Chowan University Office of Business Affairs One University Place Murfreesboro, NC 27855 Please include the student’s name and ID number on the front of all checks. If the student’s name and ID are not applicable, please make an appropriate notation in the memo line of the check. Advancement Early-Myers Development House P: 252-398-1233 E: advancement@chowan.edu Advancement Page Admissions University Welcome House 100 East High Street P: 252-398-6230 E: admissions@chowan.edu Admissions Page Business Office McDowell Columns Building P: 252-398-6290 E: businessoffice@chowan.edu Business Office Page ready for more? Request info Apply now One University Place Murfreesboro, NC 27855 P: (252) 398-6500 T: 1-888-4-CHOWAN Helpful Links Accepted Students Current Students Tuition Deposit Blackboard MyCU Paycor Login Development Offices University Resources Employment Privacy Policy © Copyright 2026 Chowan University. All Rights Reserved. Connect with us Facebook Twitter Instagram Linkedin close extended navigation Apply Visiting Chowan Request Info Tuition Deposit Search Search Site About Toggle submenu + - Empower, Enlighten, Employ Our Mission & Vision What We Believe History & Traditions Accreditations & Authorizations Office of the President Map & Directions Directory Offices University Resources Academics Toggle submenu + - Majors & Minors Academic Departments Academic Opportunities Academic Outreach Provost & Academic Affairs Honors College Chowan Connect Program Admissions Toggle submenu + - Apply Undergraduate Admissions Visiting Chowan Graduate Admissions Accepted Students Adult Degree Completion Program Financial Aid Campus Life Toggle submenu + - Campus Ministry Campus Safety Intramural Sports Residence Life Student Life Athletics Search Search Site Info For... Future Students Current Students School Counselors Alumni Give to Chowan Arts@CU Bookstore Events Directory close search Search Search Site Secret Link"
