    "https://www.chowan.edu/academics/career-services/": {
      "title": "Chowan Connect Program",
      "description": "Chowan Connect Program | Chowan University Skip to content Apply Visiting Chowan Request Info Tuition Deposit Menu open extended navigation Chowan Connect Program Home Academics Chowan Connect Program College Central Network This is where students, alumni and employers meet. Students and alumni can search for job openings. Approved employers may post jobs and search resumes. Simply register and  begin your search! Available services, help guides and announcements of interest can be accessed through the icons below. All services are available 24 hours a day, seven days a week. Visit College Central Network Welcome to The Chowan Connect Program The Chowan Connect Program serves as Chowan University’s hub for business and industry partnerships, offering a comprehensive range of services, programs, and resources. Our focus spans career exploration and decision-making, professional development, experiential learning, and employment assistance. We aim to meet the evolving needs of today’s workplace and support student goals of finding fulfilling careers. What we offer Career Services at Chowan University offers: Help with resume and cover letter writing Job listings and internships The exclusive College Central Network Annual job fairs Workshops on Financial Planning, Interviewing, and Career Planning Career Resource Library Copies of the Graduate School Guide A Senior Career Banquet for graduating seniors Students are encouraged to discuss self-assessment, summer job searches, internship opportunities, or plans for graduate or professional schools by appointment. CU Alumni The Office of Career Services at Chowan University is committed to continuing to work with the alumni of CU. Career Services will help alumni with career exploration, researching companies and positions, graduate school information, mock interviews, creating resumes, cover letters, and facilitating networking through other alumni. Hannah Rose Career Development Coordinator P hone : 252-398-6317 As an integral part of the University’s new emphasis on equipping Chowan students with the life skills they will need to succeed in the workplace, our work with business and industry partners to create internships, job shadowing opportunities, and mentorships is vital to the education of our students. Location: Hawks Nest | Chowan Connect Center Monday through Friday 8:30 am – 5:00 pm ready for more? Request info Apply now One University Place Murfreesboro, NC 27855 P: (252) 398-6500 T: 1-888-4-CHOWAN Helpful Links Accepted Students Current Students Tuition Deposit Blackboard MyCU Paycor Login Development Offices University Resources Employment Privacy Policy © Copyright 2026 Chowan University. All Rights Reserved. Connect with us Facebook Twitter Instagram Linkedin close extended navigation Apply Visiting Chowan Request Info Tuition Deposit Search Search Site About Toggle submenu + - Empower, Enlighten, Employ Our Mission & Vision What We Believe History & Traditions Accreditations & Authorizations Office of the President Map & Directions Directory Offices University Resources Academics Toggle submenu + - Majors & Minors Academic Departments Academic Opportunities Academic Outreach Provost & Academic Affairs Honors College Chowan Connect Program Admissions Toggle submenu + - Apply Undergraduate Admissions Visiting Chowan Graduate Admissions Accepted Students Adult Degree Completion Program Financial Aid Campus Life Toggle submenu + - Campus Ministry Campus Safety Intramural Sports Residence Life Student Life Athletics Search Search Site Info For... Future Students Current Students School Counselors Alumni Give to Chowan Arts@CU Bookstore Events Directory close search Search Search Site Secret Link"
